OL,3,AZack Polanski to call for three-year
OL,4,Acap on private rent rises
OL,5,
OL,6,FZack Polanski is set to call for a
OL,7,Fthree-year "emergency brake" on private
OL,8,Frent increases when he opens the Green
OL,9,FParty's conference later.
OL,11,FIn his speech to party activists on
OL,12,FFriday afternoon, the Green leader will
OL,13,Fseek to frame housing as a key issue of
OL,14,Fgenerational fairness.
OL,16,FHe will urge the government to prevent
OL,17,Fprivate rents rising above whichever is
OL,18,Flowest out of the consumer price index
OL,19,Fmeasure of inflation, wage growth or
OL,20,F2%, for three years.
OL,23,APub: 02-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,309,300,200,140,0,100
